{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virago World</strong> is a cozy yet thrilling farming and life simulation game with a unique psychological twist. By day, plant and grow beautiful flowers, work shifts at Tall Lady Victoria\u2019s flower shop, and design your dream home using the blossoms you nurture. Befriend townspeople by gifting them your prized flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining you on your journey is <strong>Ollie</strong>, a gentle yet fiercely loyal bear and Willow\u2019s best friend. Whether you\u2019re gardening in the sun or wandering through town, Ollie is always by your side, offering comfort and protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, <strong>Virago World transforms</strong>. Stalkers lurk in the darkness, and the peaceful town becomes a place of danger. With Ollie at your side, evade the shadows and survive until morning. Balance your tranquil farming life with the thrilling challenge of staying safe after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.poster.avif?t=1759873350\" width=690 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.webm?t=1759873350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.mp4?t=1759873350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>\u2022 Grow and harvest a wide variety of flowers <br>\u2022 Decorate and customize your house with your own floral designs <br>\u2022 Your pet bear best friend Ollie protecting you<br>\u2022 Survive t